<title>NEW ZEALAND: AMP has 5.16 pct relevant interest in F&amp;P.</title>
<headline>AMP has 5.16 pct relevant interest in F&amp;P.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMP Investments became on May 30 a substantial security holder in Fisher &amp; Paykel Ltd, with a relevant interest in 5.16 percent of its voting securities, the New Zealand Stock Exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
